      "name": "Gas System",
      "characteristics": [
        {
          "uuid": "00000001-AEF1-CA85-FB4D-3AAFEB7A605A",
          "description": "Gas system status",
          "valueDescription": "uint8_t\n\nonly bold values relevant for app\n0: initally closed (ok)\n1: ok\n2: leak\n3: check long closed\n4: leak check open\n5: leak confirm closed\n6: empty\n7: empty resolve\n8: low gas low output (ok)\n9: low gas low output leak check",
          "properties": "Rd Enc"
        },
        {
          "uuid": "00000002-AEF1-CA85-FB4D-3AAFEB7A605A",
          "description": "CO2 Pressure when valve is closed",
          "valueDescription": "int16_t\n\nDevelopment Value\nValue in mbar",
          "properties": "Rd Enc"
        },
        {
          "uuid": "00000003-AEF1-CA85-FB4D-3AAFEB7A605A",
          "description": "CO2 Pressure when valve is open",
          "valueDescription": "int16_t\n\nDevelopment Value\nValue in mbar",
          "properties": "Rd Enc"
        },
        {
          "uuid": "00000004-AEF1-CA85-FB4D-3AAFEB7A605A",
          "description": "CO2 Pressure Limits",
          "valueDescription": "struct (\nint16_t\nint16_t\nint16_t\nint16_t\nint16_t\nint16_t)\n\nPressure System Diganostic Limits\n\ngas_empty_low_limit (mbar)\ngas_empty_high_limit (mbar)\nleak_limit (mbar)\npress_change_limit (mbar)\npress_rise_limit (mbar)\nlglo_leak_limit (mbar)",
          "properties": "Rd Enc, Wr Enc"
        },
        {
          "uuid": "00000005-AEF1-CA85-FB4D-3AAFEB7A605A",
          "description": "CO2 Bottle",
          "valueDescription": "read:\nstruct(\nuint16_t\nuint16_t\nuint16_t)\n\nwrite:\nstruct(\nuint16_t\nuint16_t)\n\nRead:\nreleased_gas_cumulated (in g)\nbottle size (in g)\nnumber of traps\n\nWrite:\nbottle size (in g) (write 0xFFFF if you dont want to change anything, 0xFFFF will be ignored and released_gas_cumulated will not be reset)\nnumber of traps",
          "properties": "Rd Enc, Wr Enc"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "uuid": "00000000-D1D0-4B64-AFCD-2F977AB4A11D",
      "name": "OTA",
      "characteristics": [
        {
          "uuid": "00000001-D1D0-4B64-AFCD-2F977AB4A11D",
          "description": "OTA Status",
          "valueDescription": "uint8_t\n\nRead:\n0: OTA not startet\n1: waiting for data\n2: working (can´t receive data)\n3: image valid\n4: image fail\n\nwrite:\n0: abort OTA\n1: start OTA\n2: finished writing\n3: reboot",
          "properties": "Rd Enc, Wr Enc"
        },
        {
          "uuid": "00000002-D1D0-4B64-AFCD-2F977AB4A11D",
          "description": "OTA Data",
          "valueDescription": "max 200 bytes\n\nSend the new firmware chunk by chunk in the correct order",
          "properties": "Wr Enc"
        },
        {
          "uuid": "00000003-D1D0-4B64-AFCD-2F977AB4A11D",
          "description": "Dev Access",
          "valueDescription": "Write: uint32_t\n\nRead:\nstruct (\nuint8_t\nuint8_t\nuint8_t\nuint8_t\nuint8_t\nuint8_t\nuint8_t)\n\nWrite: Send the Magic Code to unlock dev access\n0x16E975D0 or\n0xD075E916\n\nWrite after sending Magic Code:\n0x00000001: reboot\n0x00000002: nvm erase\n0x00000003: change hw rev\n0x00000004: change model no\n0x00000005: change serial no\n0x00000006: change pressure calibration (untested)\n\nwhen sending a \"change xxxx\" command the next message must be the target value\n\nRead: Returns the current RTC \nSeconds\nMinutes\nHours\nDays\nWeekdays\nMonths\nYears (only last two digits)\n\n(weekdays:\nsunday: 1\nmonday: 2\n…...\nsaturday: 7)\n\nApp preview: Serial number is read-only from standard GATT 2A25 (Device Information). Hardware revision is read from 2A27. After unlock, write opcode 0x00000003 as 4-byte uint32 LE, then write the new hardware revision as UTF-8 (same encoding as 2A27). The Debug tab provides buttons to refresh SN/HW from the device and to apply a new HW revision.",
          "properties": "Rd, Wr"
        }
      ]
    }
